        Don't call it memory
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base text-mist mt-6 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        Memory is passive. Everything the agent industry calls memory is active. The word lies about what the agent is doing, and the lie shapes the system.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm text-mist mt-4">Ari Mendelow &middot; May 2026</p>
